{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[],"claim_ids":[],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e","id":"pg_0cbcfef2bbc05017b1e7f1a8fcc8329c","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/rizwan3d-stemcode-security-md-dfe4dd789988-f1a8fcc8329c.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_89c0689fc19d51909334084fca348280"],"title":"rizwan3d/StemCode/SECURITY.md @ dfe4dd789988","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_16d43335a7bcd44660f219cba308ffe4536c5339080eb465f626b5022a30707c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI binary is documented as self-contained and AOT-compiled, and all installers expose the same `stemcode` command from the same release assets."},{"claim_ids":["clm_27928b1a8f71bd1151c07835a1ccf7c68ecdd7652558b8b94a6a2e014bf15d3a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Desktop sections are saved local conversation threads per workspace that preserve history, active model, profile, thinking mode, plan state, and session state when available."},{"claim_ids":["clm_598591c31020e723ccfe711ca433001074cfef4c3f9841053120198bc15a26e8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Providers span subscription sign-in (ChatGPT Plus/Pro, Claude Pro/Max, GitHub Copilot), API-key providers (OpenAI, Anthropic, Gemini, OpenRouter, Groq, DeepSeek, and others), OpenAI-compatible endpoints, and local providers such as Ollama."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5c22cc44217616e2d5d904e69206b0f7eb528f2deef6a42c5fe78b70315bbb12"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product uses approval prompts, permissions, and profiles to keep actions under human control; `--sandbox-mode` overrides sandbox policy per run with read-only, workspace-write, or danger-full-access values."},{"claim_ids":["clm_65681661242f27f44d30df6e5eccdbe69e23ebda9676a62bce250c5c465bdca5"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The npm `stemcode` package is a thin installer that downloads the matching release binary and verifies it against published SHA256SUMS, with no .NET toolchain required; targets include win-x64, osx-x64, osx-arm64, linux-x64, and linux-arm64."},{"claim_ids":["clm_728277689f0f0bdd63bc54d7630decaee69658e9775f2ae2ecda039be7b47c8a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Release assets publish SHA256SUMS and GitHub artifact attestations; the release pipeline verifies each checksum before publishing, and `gh attestation verify` is documented for provenance checks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_d975a0b6cdce10dfefc6859497e00509664da66c578689ee0e97c5b38c0e4316"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI supports options including `--acp`, `--stdin`, `--json`, `-p/--prompt`, `--sandbox-mode`, `--session`, `--profile`, `--thinking`, and `--doctor`."},{"claim_ids":["clm_e4010c7b6011cc99f0b548fc133c4a9b34ece1f04cb5b2df5986df952c6230fa"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Built-in tracked edit tools include `file_write`, `apply_patch`, `insert_content`, and `search_and_replace`, which record before/after state and participate in `/undo`, `/redo`, and edit summaries."},{"claim_ids":["clm_ed148cfccefa9fe98049544ee7bfda1add4f97113aa25bf37af9bc16301e3f4e"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"StemCode ships as a desktop app, a `stemcode` terminal command, VS Code and Visual Studio extensions, and an ACP-compatible editor server."},{"claim_ids":["clm_eee98137ca9d49a20d6d4e07890519935a319aac12d3a7e9c7b574fbe8889c59"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Budget controls are disabled by default and activate only via `/budget local`, `/budget cloud`, or an existing `.stemcode/budget-controls.*.json` file; while disabled, no usage is recorded and provider requests are never blocked."}],"claim_ids":["clm_16d43335a7bcd44660f219cba308ffe4536c5339080eb465f626b5022a30707c","clm_27928b1a8f71bd1151c07835a1ccf7c68ecdd7652558b8b94a6a2e014bf15d3a","clm_598591c31020e723ccfe711ca433001074cfef4c3f9841053120198bc15a26e8","clm_5c22cc44217616e2d5d904e69206b0f7eb528f2deef6a42c5fe78b70315bbb12","clm_65681661242f27f44d30df6e5eccdbe69e23ebda9676a62bce250c5c465bdca5","clm_728277689f0f0bdd63bc54d7630decaee69658e9775f2ae2ecda039be7b47c8a","clm_d975a0b6cdce10dfefc6859497e00509664da66c578689ee0e97c5b38c0e4316","clm_e4010c7b6011cc99f0b548fc133c4a9b34ece1f04cb5b2df5986df952c6230fa","clm_ed148cfccefa9fe98049544ee7bfda1add4f97113aa25bf37af9bc16301e3f4e","clm_eee98137ca9d49a20d6d4e07890519935a319aac12d3a7e9c7b574fbe8889c59"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e","id":"pg_3edda6ab134c5ab997a4b3f7eb19e291","maturity":"draft","page_type":"source","path":"pages/sources/rizwan3d-stemcode-docs-documentation-md-dfe4dd789988-b3f7eb19e291.md","record_type":"page","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","source_ids":["src_4d24a2ba0f2b5b468f1b59b32a53d94b"],"title":"rizwan3d/StemCode/docs/documentation.md @ dfe4dd789988","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","updated_by_operation":"op_d381adee2a784d74a321d783002b702e"}
{"access":"public","aliases":[],"assertions":[{"claim_ids":["clm_0121697644bf3855c02ab40a15d01c565b26f7def740dba8c5afbf739366b089"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Reusable commands live in `.stemcode/commands` and long-lived project knowledge in `.stemcode/memory`, stored as versionable files users can review and commit."},{"claim_ids":["clm_16d43335a7bcd44660f219cba308ffe4536c5339080eb465f626b5022a30707c"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The CLI binary is documented as self-contained and AOT-compiled, and all installers expose the same `stemcode` command from the same release assets."},{"claim_ids":["clm_5c22cc44217616e2d5d904e69206b0f7eb528f2deef6a42c5fe78b70315bbb12"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"The product uses approval prompts, permissions, and profiles to keep actions under human control; `--sandbox-mode` overrides sandbox policy per run with read-only, workspace-write, or danger-full-access values."},{"claim_ids":["clm_728277689f0f0bdd63bc54d7630decaee69658e9775f2ae2ecda039be7b47c8a"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Release assets publish SHA256SUMS and GitHub artifact attestations; the release pipeline verifies each checksum before publishing, and `gh attestation verify` is documented for provenance checks."},{"claim_ids":["clm_c1032f0da4048c2d00d8e56ec33f93fb4488855e37ab4e527038043f5362a6d8"],"opposing_claim_ids":[],"text":"Subagents run delegated tasks with independent contexts to keep the main conversation focused, and interactive user questions support clarification, multiple-choice, multi-select, and free-form input."}],"claim_ids":["clm_0121697644bf3855c02ab40a15d01c565b26f7def740dba8c5afbf739366b089","clm_16d43335a7bcd44660f219cba308ffe4536c5339080eb465f626b5022a30707c","clm_5c22cc44217616e2d5d904e69206b0f7eb528f2deef6a42c5fe78b70315bbb12","clm_728277689f0f0bdd63bc54d7630decaee69658e9775f2ae2ecda039be7b47c8a","clm_c1032f0da4048c2d00d8e56ec33f93fb4488855e37ab4e527038043f5362a6d8"],"created_at":"2026-09-14T02:36:28Z","created_by_operation":"op_d381